  "label": "Parent-Child Bike Lesson Cultural Context",
  "description": "The image depicts a common cultural moment: a parent helping a child learn to ride a bike. This is a universal rite of passage in many societies, symbolizing growth, independence, and parental support. The meme's humor relies on subverting this wholesome image by introducing a criminal element, which requires understanding of the cultural significance of this scene.",
